    "description": "<p>Make a <strong>Spellcast Roll</strong> against a target within Far range. On a success, deal <strong>d6</strong> magic damage using your Proficiency and you may <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to make the target temporarily <em>Inscribed</em>. While <em>Inscribed</em>, the target cannot benefit from advantage.</p><p>If you use this spell as part of a Tag Team Roll, you instead deal <strong>d10</strong> magic damage using your Proficiency.</p>",
